# # /pices/odis/
#
# https://w3id.org/pices/odis/ and every path under it redirect to the same
# path under https://pices-data.github.io/odis/, the GitHub Pages site of the
# public repository pices-data/odis. The site holds the schema.org JSON-LD
# descriptions of the PICES Data Catalogue and the sitemap that the IOC Ocean
# Data and Information System (ODIS) harvests, for example:
#
# https://w3id.org/pices/odis/sitemap.xml
# https://w3id.org/pices/odis/records/zenodo-23606271.jsonld
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Brett Johnson, for the North Pacific Marine Science Organization (PICES)
# johnson@psc.org
# GitHub username: Br-Johnson
#
# PICES Secretariat
# secretariat@pices.org

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://pices-data.github.io/odis/$1 [R=302,L]
